  "prefLabel": "He-A 305.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2021-06-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 305.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish and administer a voluntary registry for operators of certified recovery houses, establish a process for receiving complaints for registered-certified recovery houses, and to allow for the distribution of a list of registered recovery houses pursuant to RSA 172-B:2,V.\n\nSource. #12821, INTERIM, eff 7-1-19, EXPIRED: 12-30-19\n\nNew. #12969, eff 1-8-20; ss by #13150, INTERIM, eff 12-30-20, EXPIRED 6-28-21\n\nNew. #13223, eff 6-26-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-a300.html"
